{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-template-book-js","path":"/books/son_of_odin_and_the_crossroads/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"url":"https://poetry.me.uk"}},"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>In Son of Odin and the Crossroads, young readers are invited into a world where courage is tested, choices matter, and even the smallest hero can walk the path of the gods.</p>\n<p>Told in 96 lively rhyming lines and brought to life through 12 vivid illustrations, this enchanting tale follows a curious boy who encounters the mighty Tiw, the god of bravery and justice. At a fateful crossroads, the boy must face fears, doubts, and difficult decisions—learning that true strength isn’t about power, but about heart, wisdom, and the courage to choose what is right.</p>\n<p>With rhythmic storytelling, striking artwork, and timeless lessons, a magical journey is woven. Perfect for bedtime reading or classroom discussion, this illustrated rhyming adventure encourages children to think bravely, act kindly, and find their own path when the road ahead seems uncertain.</p>\n<p>A story of courage, choices, and the quiet strength within us all.</p>","excerpt":"In Son of Odin and the Crossroads, young readers are invited into a world where courage is tested, choices matter, and even the smallest hero can walk the path of the gods. Told in 96 lively rhyming lines and brought to life through 12 vivid…","fields":{"slug":"/books/son_of_odin_and_the_crossroads/"},"frontmatter":{"date":"February 11, 2026","title":"Son of Odin and the Crossroads","tags":"poetry book kids poems children","book":null,"download":"/download/son_of_odin_and_the_crossroads","preview1":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":0.7067137809187279,"src":"/static/5d0cd1198c871706b381867a32a6a81f/ee604/son_of_odin_and_the_crossroads_cover.png","srcSet":"/static/5d0cd1198c871706b381867a32a6a81f/69585/son_of_odin_and_the_crossroads_cover.png 200w,\n/static/5d0cd1198c8717